{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to build a monster while your friends bother you to take breaks. Play as a mage/scientist and decide how to prioritize your time as you construct the monster. This short interactive narrative is part monster-dress-up game, part friend-dating simulator, and all how-not-to-deal-with-loss advice column. Will you fall into despair or climb back out of the well?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/2a56f4f981abca1c7a29155dc9394e5b.avif?t=1773434136\" width=1560 height=253 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what materials you use to make each part of your monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/8c506540e518ab0d5ec04cef7d6b8e69.poster.avif?t=1773434136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/8c506540e518ab0d5ec04cef7d6b8e69.webm?t=1773434136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/8c506540e518ab0d5ec04cef7d6b8e69.mp4?t=1773434136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/0f31343c327d7501b44ee0bfb3d27fbf.avif?t=1773434136\" width=1560 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconnect and learn about your neglected friends as you develop your monster. Wade through complex emotions to decide what they each mean to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/341bb3da0c2370c57f3280cb39c51e83.poster.avif?t=1773434136\" aria-label=\"a looping gif of a tree bear, budding, leafing, orange in fall, and bear again\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/341bb3da0c2370c57f3280cb39c51e83.webm?t=1773434136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/341bb3da0c2370c57f3280cb39c51e83.mp4?t=1773434136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/bfb60ff8c70e528572d6d6a9d06547ce.avif?t=1773434136\" width=1560 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move through the game, experience time passing. As your character shifts and changes, so will the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/57e8ccc13b3f932ea0043f5ba822dd63.poster.avif?t=1773434136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/57e8ccc13b3f932ea0043f5ba822dd63.webm?t=1773434136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/57e8ccc13b3f932ea0043f5ba822dd63.mp4?t=1773434136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/e4f3efd8fd270adab4e1d1f5a76fa71b.avif?t=1773434136\" width=1560 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\